@PrintDebateText Text:就跟蕾雅<br>发现尸体时<br>是同样的状态。|#0203Trial07_Ema006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR2-1,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这就是<br>我想说的……<br>目击证词。|#0203Trial07_Ema007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那就是说到底，<br>尸体被发现时的状态<br>并没有任何<br>不合理的地方<br>对吧！|#0203Trial07_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

